DOU-009 changes (2026-10-19): customs-legal 0.2.0 adds the
customs-notice-review skill reading a customs document already received
(information request, statement of grounds, decision, recovery notice,
collector's demand, official report, seizure or detention, summons,
settlement offer): author, nature and stage, separated control, formality,
debt, sanction and private-fee items, deadline mentions reproduced without
computing any date, documents and urgent questions. No observations,
challenge, defence, signature, calculation or sending. lecture-acte-douanier.md
1.0.0 added with readings of 2026-10-19 (Union Customs Code, Delegated
Regulation 2015/2446 art. 8-10, Regulation 608/2013, recodified French
Customs Code as published on 2026-04-11). qualification-douanes.md 1.1.0
and import-document-checklist now route notified acts to the new skill.
