DOU-004 changes (2026-10-19): customs-legal 0.5.0 adds the
commercial-import-intake skill qualifying an ordinary definitive import of
goods bought by a business for its activity or resale, shipped from a third
country to metropolitan France: map of roles (seller, buyer, importer on
the declaration, declarant, customs representative and type of
representation, debtor) and documents, envisaged procedure to be
confirmed, unknowns of classification, origin and value, questions to the
representative, the seller or customs kept apart from contractual
commitments. Roles and debt are never inferred from an Incoterm; no
declaration, code, rate, amount or clause; special procedures, regulated
goods and import VAT are detected and routed.
