declaration data, VAT Directive 2006/112/EC, recodified French Customs Code
legislative, regulatory and order parts as published on 2026-04-11,
customs guidance pages, TARIC and Access2Markets as tools).
qualification-douanes.md 1.4.0, biens-voyageur.md 1.0.1,
envoi-outre-mer.md 1.0.2 and the three sibling skills route business
imports to the new skill.
