Customs Code regulatory part as published on 2026-04-11, customs guidance
pages, TARIC, EBTI and Access2Markets as tools). qualification-douanes.md
1.6.0, qualification-import-professionnel.md 1.0.2,
preparation-exportation.md 1.0.1 and commercial-import-intake route
classification to the new skill.
